{
    "_id": "cantaritos",
    "name": "Cantaritos",
    "instructions": "1. If using the traditional clay cup for serving, soak it in cold water for 10 minutes before using. Otherwise, use a highball glass.\n2. Combine the tequila, orange juice, lemon juice and lime juice in the glass with a pinch of salt.\n3. Fill the glass with ice and top with grapefruit soda.",
